    "description": "Mahindra Navistar International Enterprises invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Warehouse Manager at our Ludhiana location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Mahindra Navistar International Enterprises:\nMahindra Navistar International Enterprises is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Conduct periodic vendor audits and evaluate logistics partners\n• Ensure compliance with transportation regulations and safety standards\n• Optimize delivery routes to reduce cost and improve efficiency\n• Oversee end-to-end logistics operations for timely delivery\n• Implement warehouse management systems (WMS) and track KPIs\n• Ensure proper handling, packaging, and labeling of goods\n• Manage relationships with third-party logistics providers\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• CA / CMA / CFA certification\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in WMS\n• Proficiency in Freight Forwarding\n• Proficiency in 3PL Management\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in Customs Clearance\n• Proficiency in SAP SCM\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in TMS\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Learning & development budget\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Ludhiana, Punjab, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Mahindra Navistar International Enterprises!",
